title: Customs House
text: The crystal in the gate lets some colours in and turns others away. Both lamps inside the house must burn.
trick: the gate prism lets only blue (straight) and green (bent) in, and the red the laser carries is lost; a doppler turns the blue back into red, which runs back along the green ray (yellow) and bounces off the back of the gate crystal to the red lamp
motif: a walled customs house with a crystal in its only gate; the laser outside aims straight at the gate as a decoy
accept: idea
expect: recolours>=2
